  "title": "Grandpa's Bee Haven won Best Gameplay on TipiLan!",
  "date": "2026-09-11T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Grandpa's Bee Haven won Best Gameplay on TipiLan!\n\nSeptember 11-13 is the TalTech TipiLan Game Expo. This year, I start to showcase our newly released Grandpa's Bee Haven.\n\nRelease Day\n\nAs other teammates are busy on their own business. Only I and Cagdas, our social media intern, are here on the table.\n\nCagdas\n\nExpo\n\nThere are some awesome games in this expo:\n\nMidnight Souvenirs, a cozy 2D search and find game.\n\nMidnight Souvenirs\n\nWildlings: Why is There a Zoo in Bazooka?, a cool platformer.\n\nWildlings: Why is There a Zoo in Bazooka?\n\nJazzWitch, a doodle jump like desktop game.\n\nJazzWitch\n\nEstonian Language Learning Games, a board game to learn Estonian.\n\nEstonian Language Learning Games\n\nBullosseum a battle game for bull fight.\n\nBullosseum\n\nWalk a click game.\nWalk\n\nwin 50 euros\n\nJust before I left, I got a remind to stay for longer. Turns out there is a competition during this. And grandpa's bee haven got the best gameplay!\n\nAwards\n\nGrandpa's bee haven is now on -15% discount, and you can bundle with little ghosties. You can buy our game in this link.\n\nP.S. sadyly, this year, there is not any VR game showcase. I guess it is because Tartu University is not here.",
